    "A vault is just a folder of Markdown files — no database, no import. Choose one with Open Folder as Vault or create one in iCloud Drive, and switch vaults from the vault name at the top of the sidebar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A vault is just a folder of Markdown files — no database, no import. Choose one with Open Folder as Vault or create one in iCloud Drive, and switch vaults from the vault name at the top of the sidebar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仓库就是一个装着 Markdown 文件的文件夹——没有数据库，也不用导入。用“打开文件夹作为仓库”选一个，或在 iCloud 云盘里新建一个；之后点侧边栏顶部的仓库名即可切换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "儲存庫就是一個裝著 Markdown 檔案的資料夾——沒有資料庫，也不用匯入。用「開啟資料夾作為儲存庫」選一個，或在 iCloud 雲碟裡建立一個；之後點側邊欄頂部的儲存庫名稱即可切換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A version is kept the first time this note is saved after an edit, and at most once every few minutes after that.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A version is kept the first time this note is saved after an edit, and at most once every few minutes after that."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑后第一次保存这篇笔记时会留存一个版本，之后最多每隔几分钟留存一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編輯後第一次儲存這篇筆記時會留存一個版本，之後最多每隔幾分鐘留存一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key": {
