    "Create a fine-grained token with Contents: read and write for this repository. It is stored in your Keychain, never in the vault or the settings file.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a fine-grained token with Contents: read and write for this repository. It is stored in your Keychain, never in the vault or the settings file."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为这个仓库创建一个细粒度令牌，授予“Contents”的读写权限。令牌保存在你的钥匙串中，绝不会写进仓库或设置文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "為這個儲存庫建立一個細粒度權杖，授予「Contents」的讀寫權限。權杖儲存在你的鑰匙圈中，絕不會寫進儲存庫或設定檔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
