    "GitHub shows no files on this branch, although this vault has synced before. Sync will stop rather than delete your notes — check the repository, branch and token.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub shows no files on this branch, although this vault has synced before. Sync will stop rather than delete your notes — check the repository, branch and token."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 上这个分支没有任何文件，但这个库以前同步过。同步会停下来，不会删除你的笔记——请检查仓库、分支和令牌。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 上這個分支沒有任何檔案，但這個庫以前同步過。同步會停下來，不會刪除你的筆記——請檢查倉庫、分支和權杖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
