    "Keep a vault in iCloud Drive to sync it across your devices, or turn on GitHub sync in Settings (⌘,) › Sync. This guide is always under Help › Show Welcome Guide.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
