    "One pattern per line, in .gitignore syntax — `Rules/` for a folder, `*.tmp.md` for a glob, `!keep.md` to bring one back. Skipped files are neither uploaded from here nor downloaded to here, and are never deleted from the other devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One pattern per line, in .gitignore syntax — `Rules/` for a folder, `*.tmp.md` for a glob, `!keep.md` to bring one back. Skipped files are neither uploaded from here nor downloaded to here, and are never deleted from the other devices."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行一个匹配规则，使用 .gitignore 语法——`Rules/` 表示文件夹，`*.tmp.md` 表示通配符，`!keep.md` 表示恢复某个文件。被跳过的文件既不会从这里上传，也不会下载到这里，也绝不会从其他设备上删除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行一個比對規則，使用 .gitignore 語法——`Rules/` 表示資料夾，`*.tmp.md` 表示萬用字元，`!keep.md` 表示恢復某個檔案。被略過的檔案既不會從這裡上傳，也不會下載到這裡，也絕不會從其他裝置上刪除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
