    "Reads every note again. Only needed if links, tags or search look out of date after notes were changed by another app with their dates preserved (for example a restored backup).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads every note again. Only needed if links, tags or search look out of date after notes were changed by another app with their dates preserved (for example a restored backup)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新读取每一篇笔记。只有当笔记被其他 App 修改且保留了原修改时间（例如从备份还原）后，链接、标签或搜索看起来没有更新时才需要。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新讀取每一篇筆記。只有當筆記被其他 App 修改且保留了原修改時間（例如從備份還原）後，連結、標籤或搜尋看起來沒有更新時才需要。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
