    "Runs entirely on this Mac using the model macOS already ships — nothing is uploaded and the app gains no size. The first build of a large vault takes several minutes; it saves as it goes and picks up where it left off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs entirely on this Mac using the model macOS already ships — nothing is uploaded and the app gains no size. The first build of a large vault takes several minutes; it saves as it goes and picks up where it left off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完全在这台 Mac 上运行，使用 macOS 自带的模型——不会上传任何内容，应用体积也不会增加。大型仓库的首次建立需要几分钟；过程中会边做边保存，中断后可从断点继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完全在這台 Mac 上執行，使用 macOS 內建的模型——不會上傳任何內容，App 大小也不會增加。大型儲存庫的首次建立需要幾分鐘；過程中會邊做邊儲存，中斷後可從斷點繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs on this Mac, free and offline. It cannot search your vault — ask it to rewrite, summarise or name the note in front of you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs on this Mac, free and offline. It cannot search your vault — ask it to rewrite, summarise or name the note in front of you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 Mac 上运行，免费且可离线使用。它无法搜索你的仓库——可以让它改写、总结或为眼前的笔记起标题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這台 Mac 上執行，免費且可離線使用。它無法搜尋你的儲存庫——可以讓它改寫、摘要或為眼前的筆記取標題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs on this Mac. Nothing is sent anywhere and nothing is billed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs on this Mac. Nothing is sent anywhere and nothing is billed."
