    "Sync ran out of time and will carry on by itself. Everything transferred so far is kept — the next run picks up where this one stopped, and a first sync of a large vault usually takes several.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync ran out of time and will carry on by itself. Everything transferred so far is kept — the next run picks up where this one stopped, and a first sync of a large vault usually takes several."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步超时了，稍后会自动继续。已传输的内容都会保留——下一次从中断的地方接着做；大型仓库首次同步通常需要好几轮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步逾時了，稍後會自動繼續。已傳輸的內容都會保留——下一次從中斷的地方接著做；大型儲存庫首次同步通常需要好幾輪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
