    "The on-device model cannot search your notes. It holds about 4,000 tokens and one note is usually larger than that. Use a cloud model for questions about the vault, or ask this one to rewrite or summarise the text in front of you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The on-device model cannot search your notes. It holds about 4,000 tokens and one note is usually larger than that. Use a cloud model for questions about the vault, or ask this one to rewrite or summarise the text in front of you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备端模型无法搜索你的笔记。它只能容纳约 4,000 个 token，而一篇笔记通常比这更长。关于仓库的提问请用云端模型；这个模型适合改写或总结你眼前的文字。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "裝置端模型無法搜尋你的筆記。它只能容納約 4,000 個 token，而一篇筆記通常比這更長。關於儲存庫的提問請用雲端模型；這個模型適合改寫或摘要你眼前的文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
