          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two folders pointing at one repository overwrite each other: every sync makes the repository look like whichever one ran last. Neither will sync until one of them gives it up.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two folders pointing at one repository overwrite each other: every sync makes the repository look like whichever one ran last. Neither will sync until one of them gives it up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两个文件夹指向同一个仓库会互相覆盖：每次同步都会让仓库变成最后运行的那一个的样子。在其中一个放弃之前，两个都不会同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "兩個資料夾指向同一個儲存庫會互相覆蓋：每次同步都會讓儲存庫變成最後執行的那一個的樣子。在其中一個放棄之前，兩個都不會同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type / in the assistant to use one. Claude Code's format — point this at ~/.claude/skills. Skills that run scripts contribute their instructions only, since a sandboxed app cannot launch other programs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type / in the assistant to use one. Claude Code's format — point this at ~/.claude/skills. Skills that run scripts contribute their instructions only, since a sandboxed app cannot launch other programs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在助手中输入 / 即可使用。采用 Claude Code 的格式——指向 ~/.claude/skills 即可。会运行脚本的技能只提供其说明文字，因为沙盒应用无法启动其他程序。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在助理中輸入 / 即可使用。採用 Claude Code 的格式——指向 ~/.claude/skills 即可。會執行指令碼的技能只提供其說明文字，因為沙盒 App 無法啟動其他程式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
