    "Use it for this vault only if this folder holds the same notes. Pointing two different folders at one repository makes them overwrite each other.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use it for this vault only if this folder holds the same notes. Pointing two different folders at one repository makes them overwrite each other."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有当这个文件夹里存放的是同一批笔记时，才用于这个仓库。让两个不同的文件夹指向同一个仓库，它们会互相覆盖。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有當這個資料夾裡存放的是同一批筆記時，才用於這個儲存庫。讓兩個不同的資料夾指向同一個儲存庫，它們會互相覆蓋。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
