    "Whether iCloud carries this vault depends on where the folder is, not on a switch here — a folder in iCloud Drive is synced by the system. This setting only decides whether its notes stay on this device or may be evicted to placeholders to save space.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whether iCloud carries this vault depends on where the folder is, not on a switch here — a folder in iCloud Drive is synced by the system. This setting only decides whether its notes stay on this device or may be evicted to placeholders to save space."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 是否同步这个仓库取决于文件夹所在的位置，而不是这里的开关——位于 iCloud 云盘中的文件夹由系统负责同步。这个设置只决定笔记是留在本设备上，还是可以为节省空间被换成占位符。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 是否同步這個儲存庫取決於資料夾所在的位置，而不是這裡的開關——位於 iCloud 雲碟中的資料夾由系統負責同步。這個設定只決定筆記是留在本裝置上，還是可以為節省空間被換成預留位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which copy should win?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
